		{
			dependencies: ["66E07B97EB6E41B9"]
			description: [
				"&eLignite is a low-rank coal formed from altered plant material. Compared with more coalified material, it generally retains more moisture and oxygen-rich compounds, leaving less useful energy in the same mass of fuel.&r"
				"&eMined deposits supplement the culture-assisted supply. Locally it serves as carbon stock for further fuel processing.&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
