		{
			dependencies: ["1135ECD7A3674B46"]
			description: [
				"&eCoal stores chemical energy in a compact solid fuel. It supplies furnace heat, coke manufacture and carbon-based chemistry; carbon can also help remove oxygen from metal compounds during refining.&r"
